# ===== WorkBuddy 本地缓存与记忆(不进仓库) =====
.workbuddy/memory/
.workbuddy/plugins/
.workbuddy/connectors/
.workbuddy/*.json
.workbuddy/*.db
.workbuddy/*.log

# 例外:项目级技能必须随仓库分发
!.workbuddy/skills/
!.workbuddy/skills/req-sop-harness/

# ===== SOP Harness 运行时状态(不进仓库) =====
.sop/state/
!.sop/state/README.md   # 保留状态层模板说明,仅忽略运行时生成文件

# ===== 通用 =====
node_modules/
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
